{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1000_p", "source_sha256": "07bde6f09a5ae7ccda1d5d022adca6a3d2245853e0ea809f702bb9b4a98d20dc", "ja": "（未来とグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の特集記事の\n撮影に来た。今日はパジャマ姿での撮影だが……）", "zh": "（和未来一起来拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的特辑。今天要拍的是睡衣造型，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1001_014mir", "source_sha256": "ecfa32926b9440e3694c9529f8f40ed721410051e2abab6fa5423444ed4b3d71", "ja": "{$P$}さーん……。\n撮影、どうですか～……？　ふぁ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生～……。\n拍得怎么样啊～……？哈啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1002_p", "source_sha256": "b0d47040c0a2bc5cc555186cf635532d5dbb834d61fa89251b029fe82ec5b12c", "ja": "よく撮れてるぞ。眠そうな姿にリアリティがあって。\nええと、それで、この後は……。", "zh": "拍得很好哦。困倦的样子很有真实感。\n呃，然后，接下来是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "11246894df510d612188ace7eb939a11e2c87012ee4ffd189ad1a0c824c70045", "ja": "…………むにゃ。", "zh": "…………唔喵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1004_p", "source_sha256": "652bd0879cb38bd2e522b0f64bbe45db4bc6fcff70d5f8e234d3f94b4c869e5c", "ja": "……未来？　おーい、大丈夫か？", "zh": "……未来？喂——没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "b411b6fb87631a0f7701074dd065ac79ff95ab02f2e67a00bf8714d2ab65b44c", "ja": "はっ！？　だ、大丈夫です！　でへへ……\nパジャマ着てると、なんだか眠くなっちゃいますよね。", "zh": "哈！？没、没事！嘿嘿……\n穿着睡衣，总觉得会变得很困呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1006_p", "source_sha256": "51cc22c545abbbe8e323d266dac7ba101117e3fd2286f7a181ebce62a3dde724", "ja": "本当に眠かったのか……なんていうか、大物だな。\nまあ、コンセプトには合ってるけど。", "zh": "原来是真的困啊……该怎么说呢，还真是个大人物。\n不过，倒是很符合主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "30ed483b65561d9143e98ffce68ebbd13830181deed012491390dee964cdd383", "ja": "…………はっ！？\nだ、大丈夫です！　だいじょう……ぐぅ……。", "zh": "…………哈！？\n没、没事的！　没问……呼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1008_p", "source_sha256": "5ee63a55a69070df4d292671d6e6e23aa3f9d931f66a0c9f4e0c54b857242dea", "ja": "全然大丈夫そうじゃないけど……ほら未来。\nあと1枚で終わりだから、頑張ろう！", "zh": "看起来完全不像没事的样子……来，未来。再做完1张就结束了，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "5eb1326c1dcdcec8dbb9268c9c22d7371b969dc1b4661bdb53d687b9079db2cb", "ja": "ふぁーい……がんばりまーふ……。", "zh": "好——的……我会加油的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1010_null", "source_sha256": "fa5fde92f873ed16a4810047eadef9000f11bb3158cca8750112d750e7886a42", "ja": "パシャ！　パシャパシャパシャ！", "zh": "咔嚓！咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1011_014mir", "source_sha256": "6d207ed896b5aad1b643baa27b27fd8fbbd7b5714d6721e0bb87eac1b972656a", "ja": "すー……すー……でへへ♪\n{$P$}さん、面白すぎ……むにゃ。", "zh": "呼……呼……嘿嘿♪  \n{$P$}先生，太有意思了……唔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1012_camman", "source_sha256": "561ddaacff8bcccb127b8c41e3bed50c848d8cb107c812b0b8b64fbc56f2136d", "ja": "はい、OKです！　お疲れさまでした！\nそれじゃ、私たちは失礼しますね。", "zh": "好的，没问题！辛苦了！\n那么，我们就先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1013_p", "source_sha256": "88a356053788c0b57c0d8733e88d85680be1be4feac08a6d18be1c5797a79878", "ja": "ありがとうございます、お疲れ様でした！", "zh": "非常感谢，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "57fc81544e4cbbbabea20ec37a998c339fcf451a4e968401a0f0a9e7485b5058", "ja": "わっ……わあーっ！？", "zh": "哇……哇啊——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "30a3b568a616805f93a89b22a1167f5ae6cc63ff33b6d7dee5443c48e6ab5143", "ja": "ご、ごめんなさい、{$P$}さん！\n私、完全に寝ちゃってて……！", "zh": "对、对不起，{$P$}先生！\n我完全睡着了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ae8ed11e9048bb469932963eedb4e1f80cffa04fef31a6cb0f3d76be7672a170", "ja": "おはよう、未来。よく寝てたな。", "zh": "早上好，未来。你睡得真香啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "29d939e5fef7125d56ef85c8191b08b9cec713857132209a2da91608b9ca8dc4", "ja": "うぅ～、お待たせしちゃいましたよね？\n撮影お願いしますっ！　頑張って一発OKしますから！", "zh": "呜～，让大家久等了吧？\n请开始拍摄吧！我会努力争取一条过的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "7b1668caf12fd9b6a1af030179458c6e09d4330612346d97a360a6c82da10c6d", "ja": "……。\nあ、あれ？　誰もいない……？", "zh": "……。\n咦、奇怪？没有人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1019_p", "source_sha256": "6063b9c2a16049665803fde964347d661b84fec9e7098baec994b76829f64726", "ja": "撮影なら、もう終わったぞ。いい寝顔が撮れたって、\nカメラマンさん達からも評判がよかったよ。", "zh": "拍摄已经结束了。听摄影师们说，拍到了一张很棒的睡脸，评价很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1020_014mir", "source_sha256": "961aa0fa4e764415896f18089338b3437fbe6928c669f0998672a31eb148629b", "ja": "え、ええーっ！？　寝顔って、そんな～！\nうう、恥ずかしい顔してたらどうしよう～……。", "zh": "诶、诶诶——！？睡相什么的，怎么这样～！\n呜呜，要是我当时露出了很害羞的表情，可怎么办啊～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0283_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0283_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c9e9f2b6339b7365190abf146b77dd331f7b18c10d2bf8e145843a3f3a3fd5ee", "ja": "（未来は恥ずかしがっていたが、\n雑誌はかなり好評だったようだ。やったな、未来！）", "zh": "（未来虽然有些害羞，但那本杂志似乎大受好评。干得好，未来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
